  "main_text": "GARVEE Share & Win Contest!\nWe love to see our products in action and hear about your experiences! Share your story with us, and we'll give you $30 cash for your next purchase. It's simple, fun, and a great way to show off your new GARVEE products\nGarvee Awards\n01\nWin $35\nYou will win $35 cash back for next purchase once your videos are featured\n02\nWin Up To $80\nRefer to friends and get the chance to win $80 cash for next purchase\nGetting Started\nCAPTURE\nHighlight the specific features, and share your genuine experience\nSUBMIT\nUpload your videos with the form below or send them directly to support@garvee.com\nWIN\nGet Selected and rewards: social media features, and cash awards\nSubmit Now. Get Rewarded.\nEmail Address *\nYour Name *\nAttachments *\nChoose file or drag here\nSupported format: JPG, JPEG, PNG, HEIF, HEIC, MP4, M4V.\nBrowse file\nI agree to join the GARVEE UGC program (unsubscribe anytime) *\nEmail me with update and offers (unsubscribe anytime)\nSubmit\nShare & Win FAQs:\nWhat content should be included in the videos?\nWhat are the tips to create a quality video?\nHow to know if my videos are accepted and rewarded?\nWe Garvee provide two simple ways that you can participate this contest:\n* Upload your video using the form above\n* Alternatively, you can email your video to support@garvee.com\nOur team will review your submission to ensure it meets the guidelines. Approved videos will be featured on our website and social media channels\nHow to earn more from this contest?\nSee GARVEE Share And Win\nterms + conditions\nfor more details."
}